{"ID":"20240314092107-yu5g75g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092107-yu5g75g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092107-yu5g75g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162049-2n7uohe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162049-0mgcujs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162049-0mgcujs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:160,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:160\u0026#125;","title":"【赤丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422162056"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422162049-2n7uohe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-2n7uohe","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-4noavs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-4noavs8","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四两乌头二两（炮）半夏四两（洗）（一方用桂）细辛一两《千金》作人参"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-b01rjsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-b01rjsg","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，末之，内真朱为色，炼蜜丸如麻子大，先食酒饮下三丸，日再，夜一服，不知，稍增之，以知为度。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-xcvpvgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-xcvpvgu","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"继续呢诸位看这个：“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒气厥逆，赤丸主之。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”到现在呢，非常......这赤丸很好用，但是一般的医生不会用，我现在告诉你差异在哪里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-4qk6qvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-4qk6qvk","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒气厥逆跟四肢厥逆，不一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，四肢厥逆的时候，我们用四逆汤，有生附子、干姜、炙甘草，四逆手脚冰冷。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里的寒气厥逆呢，是全身有水肿的现象，所以说你如果看到病人是水肿，四肢厥逆，有积水.，用赤丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有积水，四肢冰冷，这就是四逆汤证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"差异就在一个有水，一个没水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以诸位看，当你知道有水了以后和没水，诸位看这个处方，乌头，茯苓，茯苓是利水，半夏能够止呕，细辛能够去水。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-jdl19lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-jdl19lz","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"细辛的功能很好玩，小青龙汤里面有细辛，为什么？因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛能够把水降下去，能够止咳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为能够把水降下去，所以细辛也很好，刚刚讲大黄附子细辛汤，也在用细辛，为什么，因为他能够把水排掉，能够让......细辛药很热哦，能够让小肠这个肠的温小肠的温度起来，那同时呢细辛能够壮胆气，胆气不够的时候我们用细辛。那过去呢细辛也可以止牙痛，牙齿痛的时候，难过，拿个细辛哦自己把它塞到牙缝里面去止痛，单味药的使用很多，诸位可以参考本草经的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-82c5qil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-82c5qil","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个赤丸呢，是要做丸剂，真朱为色，就是用朱砂。那个做成丸剂以后朱砂不是混在里面的哦，朱砂不是说你在做丸剂的时候，把朱砂混进去，而是这几个药做好以后，药丸出来了，比如说一斤，对不对？那个一罐一斤，我们过去用那个指甲挑一点点哦，不是慈禧太后的指甲，一般的那个很脏的指甲，这样你就记得了，其实只有一点点的量，丢到里面去，大概一小茶匙，很少一点点的量。比如说你这个一斤的药丸，大概朱砂，只要一颗药丸的量，丢下去以后，你说老师这个会不会混合？会啊。你这样一打（摇动）全部药丸就变红色，朱砂就这样子，整个变红色，所以我们用的剂量很少，这就是朱砂包在外面。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-bkx0wef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-bkx0wef","updated":"20240422162049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个外面的中药呢，这个药商药房不懂啊要弄弄很多，卫生组织说，你看那个朱砂太过了，好，攻击说里面有汞，实际上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"朱砂里面有真铁在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们一点点的量，用一斤，你想想看，那一次几颗，你有多少的量进去？不会嘛，没有关系的哦，那过去他们不会用朱砂，才会造成这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162049-0mgcujs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162049-0mgcujs","updated":"20240422162056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那吃的时候，因为你看乌头，老师这乌头很凶，你看他只吃 3 颗，对不对？三颗不够的啦，我们叫病人吃个十颗二十颗，哪有三颗？所以寒气厥逆的时候，病人连吐出来的气都是冷的，所以我进去看，水肿全身的水肿，手脚冰冷，脉又非常的微细，手脚是冰冷，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"跟四逆汤的差异就是，水肿，简单的讲就是这样子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个消水的力量很强哦，特别非常的强。"}]}]}